// SR 291 — Chapter 3a Registered Partnership
// generated by src/parse.py. Do not edit by hand.

:NOTE
Inserted by Annex No 17 of the Same-Sex Partnerships Act of 18 June 2004, in force since 1 Jan. 2007 (AS 2005 5685; BBl 2003 1288).
Amended by No I 5 of the FA of 15 June 2012 on Measures against Forced Marriages, in force since 1 July 2013 (AS 2013 1035; BBl 2011 2185).
|

:NOTE
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.

:PATH
I. Application of Chapter 3
|

:INFO
Art. 65a
The provisions of Chapter 3 apply by analogy to registered partnerships.
|

:NOTE
Art. 65a — Amended by Annex No 2 of the FA of 18 Dec. 2020 (Marriage for All), in force since 1 July 2022 (AS 2021 747; BBl 2019 8595; 2020 1273).
|

:INFO
Art. 65b
Repealed by Annex No 2 of the FA of 18 Dec. 2020 (Marriage for All), with effect from 1 July 2022 (AS 2021 747; BBl 2019 8595; 2020 1273).

:PATH
II. Applicable law
|

:INFO
Art. 65c
Where the law applicable pursuant to Chapter 3 contains no provisions on registered partnerships, its marital law is applicable.
|

:NOTE
Art. 65c — Amended by Annex No 2 of the FA of 18 Dec. 2020 (Marriage for All), in force since 1 July 2022 (AS 2021 747; BBl 2019 8595; 2020 1273).
|

:INFO
Art. 65d
Repealed by Annex No 2 of the FA of 18 Dec. 2020 (Marriage for All), with effect from 1 July 2022 (AS 2021 747; BBl 2019 8595; 2020 1273).

